{{also|Tausend}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|dusunt|dūsunt|lang=goh}}, akin to Old Saxon ''thūsund-''. Ultimately from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|þūsundī|lang=gem-pro}}. Compare Dutch {{term|duizend|lang=de}}, West Frisian {{term|tûzen|lang=fy}}, English ''[[thousand]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtaʊ̯zn̩t/|/ˈtaʊ̯zənt/|lang=de}}
